menu "LASR prototype session recorder"
    config LASR_SD_RECORDER
        bool "Enable microSD session recorder and explicit SD self-test UI"
        default y
        help
            An experimental SD worker uses the on-board microSD via the Tab5 BSP.
            Laser detection is NOT connected. A user-triggered write/read/delete
            probe tests storage without simulating shot events or recording video.
            Do not flash until the app partition and hardware gates have passed.
    config LASR_USB_SERIAL_EXPORT
        bool "Read-only session export over existing USB Serial/JTAG console"
        depends on LASR_SD_RECORDER && ESP_CONSOLE_USB_SERIAL_JTAG
        default n
        help
            Allows LASR1 LIST/GET commands for completed sessions only.
            This is a serial downloader, not USB Mass Storage. Requires
            Windows pyserial client and actual hardware testing.
endmenu